<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="JUD" style="id">YHD ARUM</book>
  <para style="h">YAHUDA</para>
  <para style="toc1">Yahuda</para>
  <para style="toc2">Yahuda</para>
  <para style="toc3">1 Yhd</para>
  <para style="mt2">AMGBASHO ANYI NA</para>
  <para style="mt1">YAHUDA</para>
  <para style="imt">IKPI TSIFA</para>
  <para style="im">Amgbasho ata nza anyi na Yahuda reh, ma ŋa la mata akpi ashotoh kyangwri mboh ma ikpi amboh tsana ata huru tsifa reh.</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="JUD 1" />
  <para style="s1">Meh Tsifa Na Amohnoh</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JUD 1:1" />Amgbasho ata areh anyi na amya Yahuda, ahwra Yeso Kristi, mya meh bu atsini Yakubu.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JUD 1:1">Meh ŋa amgbasho reh ba nnoh mohnoh amboh ata Nnoh nza a fi reh, kyangwri amboh ata Nnoh nza bu Ada nza kira reh, amboh ata Yeso Kristi nza a de reh alindeh reh.<verse eid="JUD 1:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JUD 1:2" />Meh kwere Nnoh la ta kwini tasa tuma alindeh, tasa kira mata a bu amohnoh gaga.<verse eid="JUD 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Amboh Tsana Ata Huru Tsifa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JUD 1:3" />Ambohroh mboh ata mya nza ni kira na amohnoh reh, a te meh iko la meh ti ŋa ba nnoh ma ikpi nvara ata nza a bu ambohroh nambri reh, mya meh nza la a zohhoh meh ti ŋa ba nnoh, meh ti bleh noh tsifa ata a nati a nga noh wuwa agohsoh la meh kwere avohvoh nnoh ti shi wuwana nnoh, ma atsi nga nnoh agohsoh ata Nnoh nza a nga ma kyangwri a ŋoh amboh zanana hwana anyimbehreh reh. <verse eid="JUD 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JUD 1:4" />Meh bleh dehreh tsifa la kyangwri abibi amboh ata hwra akpi amoh a bu bleh gya anyi avoh kiri ma aniye a ba nimeh amohnoh na ayuhu, mboh amboh wohroh reh ma a sohroh a bu ahwra Nnoh mboh kpeh, ma a kira la mata a gyuru a de tsifa lisa alindeh ata Nnoh ata a zizi reh a sehneh. Ma a tsana la meh nati wina lisa andromboh ata nza a bu abibi, ma a bleh la Nnoh reh a bu alindeh tasa za la ŋoh a nati a kira ta a hwara reh kpakpana ambohroh nza mbohroh meh lisa andromboh abibi reh, tasa za ma a leke Yeso Kristi ŋoh nza a bu agba ambohroh tasa Ada ambohroh. Tana a bu ŋa gyaa nimeh amgbasho Nnoh reh la Nnoh a nati a nga iya ma biroh kyangwri abibi ika wohroh reh.<verse eid="JUD 1:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JUD 1:5" />Meh wina la ni wina noh awumu amboh ata areh nambri, meh kira meh ti kohnoh nnoh za la Ada tana a sa kyangwri Israila mboh a hwana anyi ma inzi Masar, ata areh neh a treh feh sa ka a lofo amboh ata nza ma a kira na a ŋoh kpeh reh. <verse eid="JUD 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JUD 1:6" />Kohnoh nnoh za la mgbiri mara tohmoh Nnoh mboh za tama a sa tsifa Nnoh reh a leke, neh maka ata atsi tuma amoh ata Nnoh nza nga mboh reh, Nnoh reh ka a lafa kyangwri amboh ika wohroh reh tswanza amboh nza ma a yama nimeh ida ka reh na njehnjehreh ata tuma atono nimeh shini. A nati ata mboh a bana ibi ata Nnoh a nati ahwra akpi ma kyangwri mboh reh nambri. <verse eid="JUD 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JUD 1:7" />Kohnoh nza noh za andromboh ata ta ka a hunji akpo afiya ata nza ma a fi la Sodom tasa Gomora, tasa akpokpo afiyafiya mboh nza ma a bu ma inda amoh reh, mboh reh tama a gu itoh amoh a fi a na ma aki te ndohmoh inyo atsi leh ahohndoh, tasa ndohmoh abibi ata nza a bu ma aki Nnoh kpeh. Akpokpo afiyafiya amboh wohroh reh ma a nati a nga mboh iya na shira ata tuma atono la mbohroh meh ti nza ta akpi reh ashotoh nambri ma ambohroh.<verse eid="JUD 1:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JUD 1:8" />Ma aki wohroh reh za, kyangwri amboh te lohtoh wohroh ma a de itoh amoh a chakafana, ma a leke wuwana agba ata de Agohmoh Nnoh mata a kya awumu agbugba ata Nnoh nza a lisa a gya ma inza reh <verse eid="JUD 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JUD 1:9" />Tasa ŋoh Mikailu nza a bu agba nimeh mara tohmoh Nnoh mboh reh, a kama a lisa ika ata areh kpeh. Na ameh ata ta maka a leh agohroh mboh ma agugu, ma ikpi la a bu anyi a nati a de kohmoh Musa reh, Mikailu reh a sohroh a te gbugbo atsi nga ŋoh kpakpana atsi bleh tsifa abibi kpeh, ŋoh neh a bleh la, &lt;&lt;Ada ta a hwa nnoh!&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JUD 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JUD 1:10" />Kyangwri mboh reh neh ma a leh a kya tasa ma bleh tsifa abibi ma ikpi andromboh ata mboh nza ma a nza a wina kpeh reh, tasa awumu ata agohsoh amoh nza a kira reh, ma a tswanza iwoaye mboh nza ma a bu na kohnoh kpeh reh a bu biroh awumu ika wohroh nza a nati a lofo mboh reh. <verse eid="JUD 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JUD 1:11" />iya agba na amoh, ma a tufa aki Kayinu. La tsifa fa hungroh gaga ma a hwa nimeh kpakpana ika ata Balaam reh, tasa za tama a lofo mboh ma ikpi wuwa ikpi ika ata Kora a ŋoh reh. <verse eid="JUD 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JUD 1:12" />Kyangwri mboh ika ata areh, tuma amoh nimeh irya ata dohsoh ikpi reh a bu na kpra arishi, ameh ata ma a leh a rya tasa mata wa na amohnoh reh isa ha nyiri a za a yama kpeh. Mboh reh ma a bu amboh sumu ikpi amoh ma. Ma a tswanza avereh ata inyo ka a katsi reh, awi neh ka a yama nimeh kpeh, ma a tswanza agbeh ata nza ka a mara na ameh awi kpeh reh, ha tswanza agbeh ata nza ma a krembe a kate na chuhu reh, maka a kwo nambri. <verse eid="JUD 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JUD 1:13" />Maka a tswanza amwo fini akre ata nza ka a hinga a ka na a kwere reh, ma a leh a gu ikpi a ka na awumu ata ka a de isa a ba mboh tswanza ahohhoh amwo reh. Ma a tswanza akpukpa amboh ata nza maka a hehndeh ma atsetse reh, Nnoh a lisa mboh atsi tuma ata nza bu shini ma ata tuma atono.<verse eid="JUD 1:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JUD 1:14" />Tana a bu Enok, ŋoh nza bu ika ata atehrehkifi na anyi nza anyi ma alohsoh Adamu reh, ŋoh za tana a bleh a gya ma ikpi kyangwri amboh wohroh la, &lt;&lt;Nza, Ada a nati a ba mboh ma vara mara tohmoh a ŋoh mboh amboh zanana reh, <verse eid="JUD 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JUD 1:15" />la ŋoh ta a ba ba ahwra akpi ma kyangwri mboh reh nambri, a nati a tsana ma amboh ata nza ma a bu na agohsoh Nnoh kpeh reh, ndohmoh abibi ata nza ma a lisa nza a bu ma aki Nnoh kpeh reh, tasa za tsifa abibi ata amboh kpakpana mboh amboh ata nza ma a wina Nnoh kpeh nza ma a leh atsifa ma ikpi a ŋoh reh.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="JUD 1:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JUD 1:16" />Kyangwri amboh areh ma bu amboh tsifa alulu tasa amboh nga hwa ma itoh amoh mboh, ma bu amboh tufa kohnoh abibi ata agohsoh amoh mboh reh, ma bu amboh kira ikpi amoh mboh, ma bu amboh rya sa ma kyangwri mboh la tama a hunji awumu alilehndeh ma ikpi amoh.<verse eid="JUD 1:16" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kpi Ashotoh Tasa Tsana Tsifa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JUD 1:17" />mohnoh iziza amya ata mya nza ni kira kohnoh nnoh na andromboh ata amboh ble tsifa nana Ada Yeso Kristi ambohroh ma ta ka a bleh noh ma kpikpi reh. <verse eid="JUD 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JUD 1:18" />Tama a bleh noh la, &lt;&lt;Nza ameh trina a nati a ba reh, kyangwri amboh anyi ma a nati a ba ba a leh a te nnoh inyi, kyangwri amboh wohroh reh ma a nati a leh a tufa kohnoh abibi ata nza a bu Nnoh a ŋoh kpeh reh.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JUD 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JUD 1:19" />A bu kyangwri amboh ata areh nza ma de gafana a ba reh, ma a leh a tufa kohnoh kakende ata ikpi amoh, ma a sohroh a bu na huru Nnoh kpeh. <verse eid="JUD 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JUD 1:20" />mohnoh ata mya nza ni kira neh, de noh ikpi amohnoh ma ikpi nga agohsoh ata nza ni bu noh na wohroh reh. Ti kwere nnoh Nnoh nimeh wuwana ata Huru zanana. <verse eid="JUD 1:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JUD 1:21" />tasa za ti de noh ikpi amohnoh nimeh kira Nnoh, ti bana nnoh Ada ambohroh Yeso Kristi nimeh kwini ta a nga noh fene ata tuma atono.<verse eid="JUD 1:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JUD 1:22" />Ti nza noh kwini amboh ata ma a sa tsifa Nnoh a leke reh. <verse eid="JUD 1:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JUD 1:23" />sa nnoh mgbiri mboh hwana nnoh tswanza ni fira mboh nnoh kate nyi nimeh shira, na mgbiri mboh za ti tsana mboh nnoh kwini tasa nyiri, neh ti leke nnoh kuri itoh amoh, ata nza a bu ata kohnoh kpakpana reh.<verse eid="JUD 1:23" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kwere Nnoh Ata Riri</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JUD 1:24" />Nnoh a nati a gya nnoh alindeh la ti leh rya nnoh tohmoh atsi kira na a ŋoh. Ibi anyi meh nati shi ma tomo a ŋoh na johjoh, Nnoh a nati a de noh a ba atsi ata ni nati bu alindeh. Ni nati wina shi ma inda Nnoh ata nza a shi a zanana ni shira alilehndeh. <verse eid="JUD 1:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JUD 1:25" />ata areh a bu na a ŋoh za, ata nza a bu ŋoh tsene Nnoh ata nza a nati a sa reh a hwana reh, nza a bu ma aki Yeso Kristi Ada ambohroh, nga agba, lisa alindeh, kpra Agohmoh, tasa wuwana ta a bu dehreh avoh nyi ameh jiji reh a gu a ba a te nehnehreh, tasa ata tuma atono! Avoh dehreh.<verse eid="JUD 1:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JUD 1" />
</usx>